# SHA-256 of the pinned gitleaks binary (mise.toml: gitleaks), per platform, as
# `<uname -s lowercase>-<uname -m> <sha256>`. scripts/secret-guard.sh runs only a
# binary with this hash, never one that merely prints the right version.
# Verified by hand against the release tarballs of v8.30.1: each tarball matched
# the release gitleaks_8.30.1_checksums.txt, and the hash below is of the
# extracted `gitleaks`. A new pin means re-verifying all of them.
